<HelpTab>
    <FluentText>
        <a href="/manage/checklists/today">Checklists Today</a> (under Rota in the menu) shows each of today's checklists at
        your location: which tasks are ticked, who ticked them and when, and any notes or readings.
    </FluentText>

    <HelpSection Title="Today">
        <ul>
            <li>Each checklist shows when it's due and whether it's <strong>Not started</strong>, <strong>In progress</strong>,
                <strong>Done</strong> or <strong>Overdue</strong>. Overdue means it's past its due time with tasks left.</li>
            <li>You can tick tasks here too, and untick anyone's tick if it was a mistake.</li>
            <li>Ticks made on the clock-in terminal say "on the terminal".</li>
        </ul>
    </HelpSection>

    <HelpSection Title="Past days">
        <ul>
            <li>Pick a day with <strong>Day</strong>, or use the arrows and <strong>Today</strong>.</li>
            <li><strong>Last 14 days</strong> lists every checklist that ran each day, with how many tasks were done.
                <strong>Missed</strong> means the day ended (or it went past its due time) with tasks left. Select a day to see
                exactly what was done.</li>
            <li>Past days show the tasks as they were on that day, even if the checklist has changed since. They can't be
                changed.</li>
        </ul>
    </HelpSection>
</HelpTab>
